        <p class="eyebrow">Life, as lived</p>
        <h1>What you'll <em>leave behind.</em></h1>
        <p class="lede">Not just money. A way of living that outlasts you. The last rooms of the year are about tomorrow, and about serving someone other than yourself.</p>
        <div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Begin with Russ</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="#who">Who this is for</a></div>
        <p class="guarantee">From $149 a month. Your first week is on us. Cancel any time.</p>
      </div></div>
    </section>
    <section class="sec gallery-sec faces"><div class="wrap"><p class="strip-head">The future · where you are headed</p><div class="gallery"><figure><img src="/img/russ/strip/horizon.jpg" alt="Russ facing the sunset on the beach, arms raised" style="object-position:50% 62%" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>The long view</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1501556466850-7c9fa1fccb4c?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Hands writing a plan in a notebook" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>The plan</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1593100126453-19b562a800c1?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A grandmother hugging her grandchild" style="object-position:50% 40%" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>The legacy</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>

    <section class="sec" id="what"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">What we look at</p><h2>The things you'll be remembered for.</h2><p class="lede">Legacy, purpose, the people who come after you, and the documents that protect them.</p></div>
      <div class="pains"><div class="pain"><h3>Your plan</h3><p>A will, a trust, a health directive. The three documents every adult needs, and most never sign.</p></div><div class="pain"><h3>Your purpose</h3><p>A reason you can say out loud. We help you write it and then live by it.</p></div><div class="pain"><h3>Your people</h3><p>Who you serve, who you teach, who you hand things to. Tomorrow is about them.</p></div></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec alt" id="who"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Who this is for</p><h2>Three kinds of people start here.</h2></div>
      <div class="steps"><div class="step"><div class="n">01</div><h3>Individuals</h3><p>You've reached the point where it matters what you leave, not just what you earn.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="n">02</div><h3>Business owners</h3><p>Who runs the company if you can't? Succession is a plan, not a hope.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="n">03</div><h3>Families</h3><p>You want your parents' wishes known, or your kids' future protected, before it's urgent.</p></div></div>
      <p class="offers-note">Every path starts the same way: your first key tomorrow morning, a 30-minute conversation with Russ in your first week, then $149 a month. The first week is on us. <a href="/#pricing">See pricing.</a></p>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec gallery-sec"><div class="wrap"><p class="strip-head">The future · what you leave</p><div class="gallery"><figure><img src="/img/russ/strip/football.jpg" alt="Russ throwing a football on a lawn while a child runs behind" style="object-position:50% 50%" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>The example you set</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1543342384-1f1350e27861?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="New parents holding their newborn" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>The ones who come after</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1559027615-cd4628902d4a?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A volunteer at a community event" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>The good you do</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>

    <section class="sec" id="russ-as-lived"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Russ, as lived</p><h2>How I live it.</h2></div><div class="lgrid"><figure class="big"><video style="--p:50% 62%;--pm:50% 62%" class="fg" autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" poster="/img/russ/v2/lived-running-poster.jpg" aria-label="Russ sprinting down a red running track"><source src="/img/russ/v2/lived-running.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video></figure><figure><img style="--p:50% 50%" class="fg" src="/img/russ/v2/lived-como-boat.jpg" alt="Russ driving a boat on Lake Como" width="1400" height="788" loading="lazy" /></figure><figure><img style="--p:50% 40%" class="fg" src="/img/russ/v2/lived-shore.jpg" alt="Russ in scuba gear on a rocky Mediterranean shore" width="1400" height="970" loading="lazy" /></figure><figure><img style="--p:50% 50%" class="fg" src="/img/russ/v2/lived-machu.jpg" alt="Machu Picchu above the clouds" width="1280" height="964" loading="lazy" /></figure><figure><img style="--p:50% 50%" class="fg" src="/img/russ/v2/lived-stadium.jpg" alt="The Olympic stadium in Paris" width="1400" height="1050" loading="lazy" /></figure><figure><img style="--p:50% 50%" class="fg" src="/img/russ/v2/lived-grill.jpg" alt="A spread of grilled food on the counter" width="1400" height="788" loading="lazy" /></figure></div>
    </div></section>
<style is:global>
  .lgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));grid-auto-rows:230px;gap:14px}
  .lgrid figure{margin:0;position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-radius:10px;background:#0d0f0d}
  .lgrid .big{grid-column:span 2;grid-row:span 2}
  .lgrid.tall .big{grid-column:span 1}
    .lgrid .fg{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:var(--p,50% 50%)}
  @media(max-width:760px){.lgrid .fg{object-position:var(--pm,var(--p,50% 50%))}.lgrid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));grid-auto-rows:170px;gap:10px}.lgrid .big,.lgrid.tall .big{grid-column:span 2;grid-row:span 2}.lgrid:not(.tall) .big{grid-row:span 1}.lgrid:not(.tall) figure:last-child{grid-column:span 2}}
  .lgrid.wide{grid-auto-rows:200px}
  @media(max-width:760px){.lgrid.wide{grid-template-columns:1fr;grid-auto-rows:200px}.lgrid.wide .big{grid-column:span 1}}
</style>
<script is:inline>document.querySelectorAll(".lgrid video.slow").forEach(function(v){v.playbackRate=0.5;v.addEventListener("loadedmetadata",function(){v.playbackRate=0.5;});});</script>
    <section class="sec dark" id="company"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">The documents</p><h2>Need the actual will, trust, or succession plan?</h2><p class="lede">That is legal work, and Tercet Law does it at flat fees: wills, trusts, health directives, powers of attorney and business succession. Based in Austin; Alabama licensed with Texas admission pending. It is a law firm, not coaching, and never required for coaching.</p></div>
      <div class="ctarow" style="justify-content:center"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="https://www.tercetlaw.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Yes, I need the documents ↗</a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#" data-open-form>No, I want coaching</a></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec final vid-sec" id="begin"><video class="bgvid" autoplay muted loop playsinline><source src="https://assets.mixkit.co/videos/6734/6734-720.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video><div class="veil"></div><div class="wrap">
      <h2>Start with the future.</h2><p class="lede">Begin tonight, and your first key is in your inbox at 7 a.m.</p>
      <div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Begin with Russ</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="/#pricing">See pricing</a></div>
    </div></section>
