  <div id="vh-modal" class="vh-modal" aria-hidden="true"><div class="vh-modal__bg" data-close-form></div><div class="vh-modal__card" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="Begin your year with Russ"><button class="vh-modal__x" type="button" data-close-form aria-label="Close">&times;</button><h2 class="vh-modal__title">Begin your year with Russ</h2><p class="vh-modal__sub">Tell us a little about you. Russ will write back personally, and tomorrow at 7 a.m. your first key arrives: a short teaching and one small practice to start your first chamber. Your first week is on us.</p><div class="hs-form-frame" data-region="na2" data-form-id="3f225ab5-5a70-46d9-a497-29e6256b1e52" data-portal-id="246947446"></div></div></div>
